$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Xaos" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> It started out innocently enough.  First the <vServer::TeamName0> borrowed the <vServer::TeamName1>'s lawnmower for a week and forgot to return it.  Then the <vServer::TeamName1> \"accidentally\" poured paint thinner all over the <vServer::TeamName0>'s brand new Scout.  Things kept getting worse and worse, with more severe pranks being pulled and all things shiny being stolen, until the two finally separated \"their half\" of the base with a forcefield, sitcom style.  Since the Honorable Judge Judy-tron IV was unavailable to mediate the arguement (it was sweeps week) the two came to an agreement: first one to capture the other's flag 8 times gets the entire base, plus that copy of \"Gallagher's Greatest Hits\" who's ownership is still hotly contested." ;
        
